WEBVTT

00:00:10.192 --> 00:00:11.632
(GROANING)

00:00:17.272 --> 00:00:18.832
(ICE CREAKING)

00:00:28.392 --> 00:00:30.712
Wait. Maybe I should go first.

00:00:31.552 --> 00:00:33.232
Maybe you should.

00:00:40.112 --> 00:00:42.592
You've been sneaking
second helpings, haven't you?

00:00:42.752 --> 00:00:45.312
Well, you never know
which meal's gonna be your last.

00:00:45.472 --> 00:00:47.752
Especially with your cooking.

00:00:56.392 --> 00:00:57.712
(ICE CREAKING)

00:00:57.872 --> 00:00:58.912
(SHRIEKS)

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:08.792
If Mum knew what we were doing...

00:01:08.952 --> 00:01:10.592
Mum's not here.

00:01:12.352 --> 00:01:13.752
Oh, no!

00:01:14.912 --> 00:01:16.072
Run!

00:01:19.552 --> 00:01:20.752
Hurry!

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:24.792
(SNARLING)

00:01:24.952 --> 00:01:25.992
(SCREAMS)

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:33.752
-No!
-Peter!

00:01:34.872 --> 00:01:36.632
Put that down, boy.

00:01:37.472 --> 00:01:40.432
-Someone could get hurt.
-Don't worry about me!

00:01:40.592 --> 00:01:41.912
Run him through!

00:01:42.072 --> 00:01:46.032
Leave now while you can,
and your brother leaves with you.

00:01:46.192 --> 00:01:49.272
Stop, Peter!
Maybe we should listen to him!

00:01:49.432 --> 00:01:50.432
Smart girl.

00:01:50.592 --> 00:01:53.992
Don't listen to him!
Kill him! Kill him now!

00:01:54.152 --> 00:01:57.352
Oh, come on. This isn't your war.

00:01:57.552 --> 00:02:00.832
All my Queen wants is for you
to take your family and go.

00:02:00.992 --> 00:02:03.752
Look, just because some man
in a red coat hands you a sword,

00:02:03.912 --> 00:02:07.352
it doesn't make you a hero! Just drop it!

00:02:07.512 --> 00:02:09.952
No, Peter! Narnia needs you!

00:02:10.112 --> 00:02:12.192
Gut him while you still have a chance!

00:02:12.352 --> 00:02:16.072
What's it gonna be, Son of Adam?
I won't wait forever.

00:02:16.632 --> 00:02:18.792
And neither will the river.

00:02:20.312 --> 00:02:21.512
Peter!

00:02:28.912 --> 00:02:30.392
Hold onto me!

00:02:39.552 --> 00:02:40.552
(WHINES)

00:02:47.112 --> 00:02:48.832
(SCREAMING)

00:03:30.832 --> 00:03:31.912
(SHUDDERS)

00:03:32.072 --> 00:03:33.312
Lovely.

00:03:41.472 --> 00:03:43.232
What have you done?

00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:47.232
Lucy!

00:03:49.352 --> 00:03:50.672
Lucy!

00:03:55.672 --> 00:03:57.752
LUCY: Has anyone seen my coat?

00:04:04.232 --> 00:04:06.152
Don't you worry, dear.

00:04:06.352 --> 00:04:09.592
Your brother's got you
well looked after.

00:04:09.752 --> 00:04:13.432
And I don't think you'll be
needing those coats any more.

00:04:37.032 --> 00:04:38.752
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

00:04:48.712 --> 00:04:51.072
It's so warm out.

00:04:54.992 --> 00:04:57.272
I'll go and check the sleigh.

00:04:59.512 --> 00:05:01.152
Your Majesty.

00:05:01.752 --> 00:05:03.072
We found the traitor.

00:05:03.232 --> 00:05:05.392
He was rallying your enemies
near the Shuddering Woods.

00:05:05.552 --> 00:05:06.632
(YELPS)

00:05:07.432 --> 00:05:08.992
Nice of you to drop in.

00:05:09.152 --> 00:05:11.912
You were so helpful
to my wolves last night.

00:05:12.072 --> 00:05:14.312
Perhaps you can help me now.

00:05:14.912 --> 00:05:18.272
-Forgive me, Your Majesty.
-Oh, don't waste time with flattery.

00:05:18.432 --> 00:05:22.312
Not to seem rude,
but I wasn't actually talking to you.

00:05:31.592 --> 00:05:33.912
Where are the humans headed?

00:05:37.992 --> 00:05:42.472
Wait! No! Don't. The beaver said
something about the Stone Table,

00:05:42.632 --> 00:05:45.192
and that Aslan had an army there.

00:05:46.112 --> 00:05:47.552
An army?

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:53.512
(SIGHS)

00:05:53.672 --> 00:05:55.552
Thank you, Edmund.

00:05:55.712 --> 00:05:59.192
I'm glad this creature
got to see some honesty

00:06:00.592 --> 00:06:03.312
-before he dies.
-No!

00:06:13.992 --> 00:06:16.792
Think about whose side you're on,
Edmund.

00:06:17.592 --> 00:06:19.032
Mine

00:06:21.432 --> 00:06:22.912
or theirs.

00:06:29.232 --> 00:06:31.672
Go on ahead. Gather the faithful.

00:06:32.592 --> 00:06:34.832
If it's a war Aslan wants,

00:06:37.152 --> 00:06:39.272
it's a war he shall get.

00:06:41.512 --> 00:06:43.472
(PEOPLE CHATTERING)

00:06:43.672 --> 00:06:45.392
(HORN BLOWING)

